Command
  Opcode  0x25  GET_STATUS
  CRC  0xFB  ok
TAR  2 clocks
Response
  WAIT_STATE  2 byte-times of delay, excluded from CRC
  Response  0x08  ACCEPT
  Status  0x010F
    PC_FREE  bit 0 = 1
    NP_FREE  bit 1 = 1
    VWIRE_FREE  bit 2 = 1
    OOB_FREE  bit 3 = 1
    FLASH_C_FREE  bit 8 = 1
  CRC  0x95  ok
